# cavebat.c is the FLYING firmware (tags v4-flying-withMR / v5-first-full-cycle)
# and is what is on the drone. Only ONE of these may be built -- they all
# define appMain().
#
#   cavebat.c          FLIES. Takeoff, timed hover, land. No recording.
#   cavebat_record.c   cavebat.c + onboard recording and CRTP-14 download.
#                      BUILT AND READY, NOT FLASHED. Binary saved as
#                      pending-cavebat-record.bin.
#   cavebat_i2cscan.c  DIAGNOSTIC, does not fly. Scans the deck I2C bus.
#   cavebat_v3.c       an earlier recording attempt; flipped on takeoff.
#   cavebat_v2.c       wall following; also flipped on takeoff.
